  "groups": [
    {
      "all_of": [
        {
          "condition": "Bob is quiet",
          "item": "m_00da1e"  // any candidate stating quiet; we choose m_00da1e as it mentions Bob (white) and thus implies entity context
        },
        {
          "condition": "Bob is nice",
          "item": "m_004ca8"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

*Note:* The first condition could alternatively be satisfied by **m_001a57** ("Charlie is quiet"), but since the memory is about **Bob**, we select a candidate that refers to Bob, i.e., **m_00da1e**, which is the only remaining Bob‑related candidate. This satisfies the requirement that the condition be about the same entity (Bob).

